Author: Sprite <noreply@sprites.dev>
Date:   Mon Jul 6 22:32:00 2026 +0000

    fix(profiles): stop legacy sync migration from clobbering saved settings

    The migration effect had no one-shot guard, so it re-ran on every
    profilesSnapshot/profilesBusy change (i.e. every settings save) and
    overwrote freshly-saved git settings with the stale localStorage blob.
    Add a useRef flag so migration runs at most once per app session.

